  "body": "## Goal\nLet reviewers and gates list the exact tests that a diff affects in seconds without building.\n\n## Scope\n- Add `cargo xtask impact [--base main] [--map <path>] [--history <path>] [--format text|json|nextest]` in `xtask`.\n- Read changed functions from `diff_fns` and query the compressed coverage map for matching test names.\n- Include file-level coverage hits for hunks outside functions.\n- Union those hits with fixture, asset, and catalog readers from `xtask/src/fixture_inputs.rs`, `xtask/src/assets.rs`, and `xtask/src/catalog.rs`.\n- Fall back to `xtask/src/quick.rs` Gate maps and optional `graphify affected` output when a changed function has no coverage entry.\n- Format output as a readable list (`text`), structured records (`json`), or a nextest filter expression (`nextest`, `test(=...) | ...`).\n- Degrade cleanly to Gate maps and fixture readers with a one-line notice when no map file exists.\n\n## Done means\n`cargo xtask impact --base <sha> --map <fixture>` finishes in under 5 seconds with no build, lists both `app:feature_edge_g1_join::no_pickable_edge_is_a_tangent_piece_of_a_longer_one_in_any_step_fixture` and `kernel:step_agreement::step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name` for the diff of PR #2664, and passes `xtask` unit tests.\n\nPart of #2738",
